<section class="contact-opening wrap" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
<p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
<h1 id="contact-title">A shared ambition.<br>A <em>real conversation.</em></h1>
<p class="lede">Explore the products, discuss a partnership, or speak with the founder about the company’s direction.</p>
</section>
<section class="contact-destination wrap" id="prepare-inquiry" aria-labelledby="contact-person-title" tabindex="-1">
<div class="contact-direct"><p id="contact-context" class="contact-context">Start with an introduction.</p><a id="contact-email" class="contact-email" href="mailto:{{ email }}?subject=Solarity%20AI%20%7C%20Other"><span>{{ email }}</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>{{ copy_button(email, 'contact-email-copy-status') }}<p class="contact-direct-help">Write directly to Ata in your email app. A little context and the next step you have in mind are enough.</p><div class="contact-booking">{{ btn('Book a conversation', booking, 'outline', True)|safe }}<span>Choose a time on Google Calendar.</span></div></div>
<div class="contact-person"><p class="eyebrow">Your point of contact</p><h2 id="contact-person-title">Ata Turhan</h2><p class="contact-person-role">Founder, Solarity AI</p><p>Dallas, Texas, United States</p><div class="contact-person-links"><a class="text-link" href="/company">Meet the company <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="text-link" href="{{ vcard }}" download="Ata Turhan.vcf">Add Ata to your contacts <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>{% if linkedin %}<a class="text-link" href="{{ linkedin }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>{% endif %}</div></div>
</section>
<section class="contact-topics wrap" aria-labelledby="contact-topics-title"><div class="contact-topics-heading"><h2 id="contact-topics-title">What would you like to explore?</h2><p>Choose a topic to open an email with the subject ready.</p><p class="contact-topics-fallback">No email app? Write to <span class="contact-address">{{ email }}</span>.</p>{{ copy_button(email, 'contact-topics-copy-status') }}</div><div class="contact-topic-list">
{%- for topic in topics -%}
<a class="contact-topic" data-inquiry-type="{{ topic.kind }}" href="{{ topic.href }}"><span class="contact-topic-icon">{{ symbol(topic.icon)|safe }}</span><span><strong>{{ topic.title }}</strong><span>{{ topic.description }}</span></span><span class="contact-topic-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
{%- endfor -%}
</div></section>
<section class="contact-topics contact-more wrap" aria-labelledby="contact-more-title"><div class="contact-topics-heading"><h2 id="contact-more-title">More ways to connect</h2><p>Forms open Google Forms in a new tab.</p></div><div><div class="contact-topic-list">
{%- for form in forms -%}
<a class="contact-topic" href="{{ form.href }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="contact-topic-icon">{{ symbol(form.icon)|safe }}</span><span><strong>{{ form.title }}</strong><span>{{ form.description }}</span></span><span class="contact-topic-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>
{%- endfor -%}
</div><p class="contact-follow">Follow Solarity AI on
{%- for label, href in profiles %} <a href="{{ href }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ label }}<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>{% if not loop.last %} ·{% endif %}{% endfor %}</p></div></section>
<div class="contact-data-note wrap" id="data-note"><h2>About this contact experience</h2><p>Email links open your email app. You review and send the message there. This website does not collect or submit contact messages. Booking opens Google Calendar, and the feedback, mentorship and certificate forms open Google Forms.</p><p>For job opportunities, visit <a href="/careers">careers</a> or email <a href="mailto:careers@solarityai.com">careers@solarityai.com</a>.</p></div>
